= Gertrud Scholtz-Klink

Scholtz-Klink is the leader of the NS-Frauenschaft (National Socialist Women's League). She approaches mobilization through the lens of traditional family structures, serving as our primary bridge to conservative housewives and rural mothers.

- @emergency_street_collections
- @winter_relief
- @organizing_housewives
- @root: Return to main

@emergency_street_collections
title: Emergency Street Collections
subtitle: An emergency infusion of party funds through aggressive public drives.
