We have increased funding to our Winter Relief program. [? if black_thursday_seen > 0 : In an age of economic crisis, providing fuel and hot meals directly to the poor allows us to easily out-mobilize the state welfare systems among the unemployed. ?]

@organizing_housewives
title: Mobilizing Conservative Women
subtitle: Target women by championing their traditional household and maternal roles.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: traditional_gender_support += 1; working_class_nsdap += 4*(1-internal_party_dissent); rural_nsdap += 3*(1-internal_party_dissent); old_middle_nsdap += 3*(1-internal_party_dissent); advisor_action_timer = 6

Scholtz-Klink's strategies for organizing women are aimed squarely at housewives and rural mothers, celebrating their traditional domestic duties. We argue that our national program will safeguard the household and protect families from Marxist collapse.

[? nsdap_votes < 50 : Unfortunately, millions of women still disproportionately trust the Catholic Center Party to protect family values. ?]
